<p data-start=3D"1230" data-end=3D"1275" class=3D"">Nouvelle g=C3=A9n=C3=A9=
ration de serveur d=E2=80=99affichage.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1276" data-end=3D"1316" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1278" data-end=3D"1316" class=3D"">Plus s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9=
 et performant que X11.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1317" data-end=3D"1383" class=3D"">
