<h2 data-start=3D"2681" data-end=3D"2727" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2684" data-end=3D"2725">4. Navigation et Gestion des Fichiers</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2729" data-end=3D"2760" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2733" data-end=3D"2758">4.1 Ouvrir un Dossier</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2761" data-end=3D"2997">
<li data-start=3D"2761" data-end=3D"2799" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2763" data-end=3D"2799" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
763" data-end=3D"2781">Double-cliquer</strong> sur un dossier.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2800" data-end=3D"2883" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2802" data-end=3D"2883" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
802" data-end=3D"2833">Utiliser la barre d=E2=80=99adresse</strong> pour en=
trer un chemin (<code data-start=3D"2857" data-end=3D"2879">/home/user/Docu=
ments</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2884" data-end=3D"2997" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2886" data-end=3D"2997" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
886" data-end=3D"2919">Utiliser le raccourci clavier</strong> <code data-st=
art=3D"2920" data-end=3D"2930">Ctrl + L</code> pour activer la barre d=E2=
=80=99adresse et entrer un chemin directement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2999" data-end=3D"3055" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3003" data-end=3D"3053">4.2 Copier, D=C3=A9placer et Supprimer des Fichiers=
</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"overflow-x-auto contain-inline-size"><table data-start=3D"305=
6" data-end=3D"3325" node=3D"[object Object]"><thead data-start=3D"3056" da=
