/td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p data-start=3D"3327" data-end=3D"3468" class=3D"">=F0=9F=92=A1 <strong da=
ta-start=3D"3330" data-end=3D"3340">Astuce</strong> : Dans <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"3348" data-end=3D"3359">Dolphin</strong>, vous pouvez <strong data-st=
art=3D"3373" data-end=3D"3392">glisser-d=C3=A9poser</strong> un fichier en =
maintenant <code data-start=3D"3418" data-end=3D"3425">Shift</code> pour le=
 d=C3=A9placer ou <code data-start=3D"3446" data-end=3D"3452">Ctrl</code> p=
our le copier.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3470" data-end=3D"3514" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3474" data-end=3D"3512">4.3 S=C3=A9lection Multiple de Fichiers</strong></h=
3>
<ul data-start=3D"3515" data-end=3D"3717">
<li data-start=3D"3515" data-end=3D"3613" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3517" data-end=3D"3613" class=3D"">Maintenir <strong data-=
start=3D"3527" data-end=3D"3537"><code data-start=3D"3529" data-end=3D"3535=
">Ctrl</code></strong> et cliquer sur plusieurs fichiers pour les s=C3=A9le=
ctionner individuellement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3614" data-end=3D"3680" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3616" data-end=3D"3680" class=3D"">Maintenir <strong data-=
start=3D"3626" data-end=3D"3637"><code data-start=3D"3628" data-end=3D"3635=
">Shift</code></strong> pour s=C3=A9lectionner une plage de fichiers.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3681" data-end=3D"3717" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3683" data-end=3D"3717" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"368=
3" data-end=3D"3693">Ctrl + A</code> pour tout s=C3=A9lectionner.</p>
</li>
</ul>
