3781" data-end=3D"3812">5.1 Rechercher des Fichiers</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3815" data-end=3D"4047">
<li data-start=3D"3815" data-end=3D"3883" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3817" data-end=3D"3883" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
817" data-end=3D"3837">Nautilus (GNOME)</strong> : <code data-start=3D"3840=
