<h3 data-start=3D"4335" data-end=3D"4398" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4339" data-end=3D"4396">2.2. Utilisation de <code data-start=3D"4361" data-=
end=3D"4368">chmod</code> avec des Codes Num=C3=A9riques</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4400" data-end=3D"4524" class=3D"">Les permissions peuvent=
 =C3=A9galement =C3=AAtre sp=C3=A9cifi=C3=A9es =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99aide de cod=
es num=C3=A9riques. Chaque permission a une valeur num=C3=A9rique :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4525" data-end=3D"4599">
<li data-start=3D"4525" data-end=3D"4548" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4527" data-end=3D"4548" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
527" data-end=3D"4542">Lecture (r)</strong> =3D 4</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4549" data-end=3D"4573" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4551" data-end=3D"4573" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
551" data-end=3D"4567">=C3=89criture (w)</strong> =3D 2</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4574" data-end=3D"4599" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4576" data-end=3D"4599" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
576" data-end=3D"4593">Ex=C3=A9cution (x)</strong> =3D 1</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4601" data-end=3D"4738" class=3D"">La valeur totale de cha=
que cat=C3=A9gorie d=E2=80=99utilisateurs (propri=C3=A9taire, groupe, autre=
s) est obtenue en additionnant ces valeurs. Par exemple :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4739" data-end=3D"4810">
<li data-start=3D"4739" data-end=3D"4762" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4741" data-end=3D"4762" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"474=
1" data-end=3D"4746">rwx</code> =3D 4 + 2 + 1 =3D 7</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4763" data-end=3D"4786" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4765" data-end=3D"4786" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"476=
5" data-end=3D"4770">rw-</code> =3D 4 + 2 + 0 =3D 6</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4787" data-end=3D"4810" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4789" data-end=3D"4810" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"478=
9" data-end=3D"4794">r--</code> =3D 4 + 0 + 0 =3D 4</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4812" data-end=3D"4897" class=3D"">Ainsi, vous pouvez util=
iser un code =C3=A0 trois chiffres pour d=C3=A9finir les permissions :</p>
