<h4 data-start=3D"3676" data-end=3D"3702" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3681" data-end=3D"3702">2.1.2. Mode Octal</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"3704" data-end=3D"3824" class=3D"">Le mode octal utilise d=
es chiffres pour repr=C3=A9senter les permissions. Chaque permission est re=
pr=C3=A9sent=C3=A9e par un chiffre :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3825" data-end=3D"3899">
<li data-start=3D"3825" data-end=3D"3848" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3827" data-end=3D"3848" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
827" data-end=3D"3844">Lecture (<code data-start=3D"3838" data-end=3D"3841"=
>r</code>)</strong> : 4</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3849" data-end=3D"3873" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3851" data-end=3D"3873" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
851" data-end=3D"3869">=C3=89criture (<code data-start=3D"3863" data-end=3D=
"3866">w</code>)</strong> : 2</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3874" data-end=3D"3899" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3876" data-end=3D"3899" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
876" data-end=3D"3895">Ex=C3=A9cution (<code data-start=3D"3889" data-end=
=3D"3892">x</code>)</strong> : 1</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3901" data-end=3D"4100" class=3D"">Ces valeurs sont additi=
onn=C3=A9es pour chaque cat=C3=A9gorie d'utilisateur (propri=C3=A9taire, gr=
oupe, autres). Par exemple, les permissions <code data-start=3D"4028" data-=
end=3D"4033">rwx</code> sont =C3=A9gales =C3=A0 7 (4 + 2 + 1), et <code dat=
a-start=3D"4066" data-end=3D"4071">r-x</code> sont =C3=A9gales =C3=A0 5 (4 =
+ 0 + 1).</p>
