>sudo</code> pour ex=C3=A9cuter des commandes administratives.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4944" data-end=3D"4947" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4949" data-end=3D"4990" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
