<h3 data-start=3D"7066" data-end=3D"7105" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7070" data-end=3D"7105">4.3. S=C3=A9curiser les Sessions SSH</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7107" data-end=3D"7167" class=3D"">Pour renforcer la s=C3=
=A9curit=C3=A9 des connexions SSH, vous pouvez :</p>
