<h4 data-start=3D"2014" data-end=3D"2060" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2019" data-end=3D"2060">Interpr=C3=A9tation des R=C3=A9sultats de <code dat=
a-start=3D"2053" data-end=3D"2058">top</code></strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"2062" data-end=3D"2117" class=3D"">L'interface de <code da=
ta-start=3D"2077" data-end=3D"2082">top</code> affiche plusieurs colonnes, =
dont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2119" data-end=3D"2321">
<li data-start=3D"2119" data-end=3D"2193" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2121" data-end=3D"2193" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
121" data-end=3D"2129">%CPU</strong> : Pourcentage d'utilisation du process=
eur par chaque processus.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2194" data-end=3D"2269" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2196" data-end=3D"2269" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
196" data-end=3D"2204">%MEM</strong> : Pourcentage de la m=C3=A9moire (RAM)=
 utilis=C3=A9e par chaque processus.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2270" data-end=3D"2321" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2272" data-end=3D"2321" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
272" data-end=3D"2281">TIME+</strong> : Temps total d'ex=C3=A9cution du pro=
cessus.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2323" data-end=3D"2410" class=3D"">En haut de l'=C3=A9cran=
, vous trouverez des informations globales sur l'utilisation du CPU :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2412" data-end=3D"2683">
<li data-start=3D"2412" data-end=3D"2491" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2414" data-end=3D"2491" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
414" data-end=3D"2421">%us</strong> : Pourcentage de l'usage du processeur =
par les processus utilisateur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2492" data-end=3D"2567" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2494" data-end=3D"2567" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
494" data-end=3D"2501">%sy</strong> : Pourcentage de l'usage du processeur =
par les processus syst=C3=A8me.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2568" data-end=3D"2623" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2570" data-end=3D"2623" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
570" data-end=3D"2577">%id</strong> : Pourcentage de temps o=C3=B9 le CPU e=
st inactif.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2624" data-end=3D"2683" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2626" data-end=3D"2683" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
626" data-end=3D"2633">%wa</strong> : Temps pass=C3=A9 =C3=A0 attendre l'ac=
c=C3=A8s au disque (I/O).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"2685" data-end=3D"2714" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2690" data-end=3D"2714">Filtres et Commandes</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"2716" data-end=3D"2996">
<li data-start=3D"2716" data-end=3D"2767" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2718" data-end=3D"2767" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
718" data-end=3D"2735">Quitter <code data-start=3D"2728" data-end=3D"2733">=
top</code></strong> : Appuyez sur <code data-start=3D"2750" data-end=3D"275=
3">q</code> pour quitter.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2768" data-end=3D"2909" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2770" data-end=3D"2909" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
770" data-end=3D"2809">Changer l'intervalle de mise =C3=A0 jour</strong> : =
Appuyez sur <code data-start=3D"2824" data-end=3D"2827">d</code> puis entre=
z un nombre en secondes pour modifier l'intervalle de rafra=C3=AEchissement=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2910" data-end=3D"2996" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2912" data-end=3D"2996" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
912" data-end=3D"2929">Trier par CPU</strong> : Appuyez sur <code data-star=
t=3D"2944" data-end=3D"2947">P</code> pour trier les processus par utilisat=
ion du CPU.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2998" data-end=3D"3050" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3002" data-end=3D"3050">2.2. <code data-start=3D"3009" data-end=3D"3015">ht=
op</code> - Une Version Am=C3=A9lior=C3=A9e de <code data-start=3D"3043" da=
ta-end=3D"3048">top</code></strong></h3>
