ations importantes, comme suit :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3189" data-end=3D"3515">
<li data-start=3D"3189" data-end=3D"3250" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3191" data-end=3D"3250" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
191" data-end=3D"3200">total</strong> : La m=C3=A9moire totale disponible (=
physique + swap).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3251" data-end=3D"3284" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3253" data-end=3D"3284" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
253" data-end=3D"3261">used</strong> : La m=C3=A9moire utilis=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3285" data-end=3D"3315" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3287" data-end=3D"3315" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
287" data-end=3D"3295">free</strong> : La m=C3=A9moire libre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3316" data-end=3D"3377" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3318" data-end=3D"3377" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
318" data-end=3D"3328">shared</strong> : La m=C3=A9moire partag=C3=A9e entr=
e plusieurs processus.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3378" data-end=3D"3447" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3380" data-end=3D"3447" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
380" data-end=3D"3397">buffers/cache</strong> : La m=C3=A9moire utilis=C3=
=A9e pour les buffers et caches.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3448" data-end=3D"3515" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3450" data-end=3D"3515" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
450" data-end=3D"3463">available</strong> : La m=C3=A9moire disponible pour=
