age-bash"><span><span>vmstat 1
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start=3D"4187" data-end=3D"4342" class=3D"">Cela affiche un rapport=
 toutes les secondes sur la m=C3=A9moire utilis=C3=A9e, les processus en co=
urs, les pages =C3=A9chang=C3=A9es et d=E2=80=99autres m=C3=A9triques syst=
=C3=A8me importantes.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4344" data-end=3D"4347" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4349" data-end=3D"4414" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4352" data-end=3D"4414">3. Techniques de Gestion des Processus en Cas de Su=
rcharge</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4416" data-end=3D"4479" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4420" data-end=3D"4479">3.1. Priorisation des Processus avec <code data-sta=
rt=3D"4459" data-end=3D"4465">nice</code> et <code data-start=3D"4469" data=
-end=3D"4477">renice</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4481" data-end=3D"4632" class=3D"">Lorsque le syst=C3=A8me=
 est sous une forte charge, il peut =C3=AAtre utile de changer la priorit=
=C3=A9 d=E2=80=99un processus pour donner la priorit=C3=A9 aux processus cr=
itiques.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4634" data-end=3D"4660" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4639" data-end=3D"4658">Commande <code data-start=3D"4650" data-end=3D"4656=
