=C3=A9 du processus sp=C3=A9cifi=C3=A9 par le PID.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5147" data-end=3D"5212" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5151" data-end=3D"5212">3.2. Mise en Arri=C3=A8re-Plan des Processus avec <=
code data-start=3D"5198" data-end=3D"5202">bg</code> et <code data-start=3D=
"5206" data-end=3D"5210">fg</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5214" data-end=3D"5355" class=3D"">Lorsque le syst=C3=A8me=
 est sous forte charge, vous pouvez d=C3=A9placer certains processus non es=
sentiels en arri=C3=A8re-plan pour lib=C3=A9rer des ressources.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5357" data-end=3D"5464">
<li data-start=3D"5357" data-end=3D"5416" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5359" data-end=3D"5416" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
359" data-end=3D"5367"><code data-start=3D"5361" data-end=3D"5365">bg</code=
></strong> : D=C3=A9place un processus suspendu en arri=C3=A8re-plan.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5417" data-end=3D"5464" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5419" data-end=3D"5464" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
419" data-end=3D"5427"><code data-start=3D"5421" data-end=3D"5425">fg</code=
></strong> : Ram=C3=A8ne un processus en avant-plan.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5466" data-end=3D"5480" class=3D"">Exemple :</h4>
<ol data-start=3D"5482" data-end=3D"5600">
<li data-start=3D"5482" data-end=3D"5527" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5485" data-end=3D"5527" class=3D"">Suspendre un processus =
en cours : <code data-start=3D"5519" data-end=3D"5527">Ctrl+Z</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5528" data-end=3D"5565" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5531" data-end=3D"5565" class=3D"">Le d=C3=A9placer en arr=
i=C3=A8re-plan : <code data-start=3D"5561" data-end=3D"5565">bg</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5566" data-end=3D"5600" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5569" data-end=3D"5600" class=3D"">Le ramener en avant-pla=
n : <code data-start=3D"5596" data-end=3D"5600">fg</code></p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5602" data-end=3D"5665" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5606" data-end=3D"5665">3.3. Limitation de l'Utilisation du CPU avec <code =
data-start=3D"5653" data-end=3D"5663">cpulimit</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5667" data-end=3D"5851" class=3D"">Le programme <code data=
-start=3D"5680" data-end=3D"5690">cpulimit</code> permet de limiter l'utili=
