<h4 data-start=3D"5268" data-end=3D"5340" class=3D"">Utilisation de <code d=
ata-start=3D"5288" data-end=3D"5295">dmesg</code> pour diagnostiquer les pr=
obl=C3=A8mes mat=C3=A9riels :</h4>
<p data-start=3D"5341" data-end=3D"5566" class=3D"">Si un p=C3=A9riph=C3=A9=
rique, comme un disque dur ou une carte r=C3=A9seau, ne fonctionne pas corr=
ectement, les messages du noyau dans <code data-start=3D"5461" data-end=3D"=
5468">dmesg</code> peuvent indiquer des erreurs de p=C3=A9riph=C3=A9rique, =
des probl=C3=A8mes de pilote, ou des conflits mat=C3=A9riels.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5568" data-end=3D"5571" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5573" data-end=3D"5620" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5576" data-end=3D"5620">3. Comparaison entre <code data-start=3D"5599" data=
-end=3D"5607">syslog</code> et <code data-start=3D"5611" data-end=3D"5618">=
dmesg</code></strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5622" data-end=3D"5658" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5626" data-end=3D"5658">3.1. Diff=C3=A9rences Principales</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5660" data-end=3D"6582">
<li data-start=3D"5660" data-end=3D"5942" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5662" data-end=3D"5688" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
662" data-end=3D"5686">Origine des Messages</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5691" data-end=3D"5942">
<li data-start=3D"5691" data-end=3D"5806" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5693" data-end=3D"5806" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"569=
3" data-end=3D"5701">syslog</code> : Collecte les messages provenant de dif=
f=C3=A9rents services du syst=C3=A8me (noyau, applications, utilisateurs).<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5809" data-end=3D"5942" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5811" data-end=3D"5942" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"581=
1" data-end=3D"5818">dmesg</code> : Affiche sp=C3=A9cifiquement les message=
s du noyau concernant le mat=C3=A9riel, les pilotes, et les =C3=A9v=C3=A9ne=
ments syst=C3=A8me au d=C3=A9marrage.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5944" data-end=3D"6309" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5946" data-end=3D"5963" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
946" data-end=3D"5961">Persistance</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5966" data-end=3D"6309">
<li data-start=3D"5966" data-end=3D"6086" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5968" data-end=3D"6086" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"596=
8" data-end=3D"5976">syslog</code> : Les fichiers journaux g=C3=A9n=C3=A9r=
=C3=A9s sont persistants et sont stock=C3=A9s sur disque (par exemple, <cod=
e data-start=3D"6067" data-end=3D"6084">/var/log/syslog</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6089" data-end=3D"6309" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6091" data-end=3D"6309" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"609=
