<p data-start=3D"6079" data-end=3D"6182" class=3D"">Cela appliquera automat=
iquement les mises =C3=A0 jour de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 sur votre syst=C3=A8me=
 =C3=A0 intervalles r=C3=A9guliers.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6184" data-end=3D"6187" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6189" data-end=3D"6235" class=3D"">4. Outils et Pratiques=
 de S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 Avanc=C3=A9es</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6237" data-end=3D"6299" class=3D"">4.1. Utilisation de <s=
trong data-start=3D"6261" data-end=3D"6275">apt-secure</strong> et <strong =
data-start=3D"6279" data-end=3D"6299">dnf-plugins-core</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6301" data-end=3D"6555" class=3D"">Les outils <strong data=
-start=3D"6312" data-end=3D"6326">apt-secure</strong> et <strong data-start=
=3D"6330" data-end=3D"6350">dnf-plugins-core</strong> vous aident =C3=A0 ga=
rantir que vous t=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargez et appliquez des mises =C3=A0 jour de=
 sources fiables. Vous pouvez configurer des <strong data-start=3D"6472" da=
ta-end=3D"6492">d=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9s</strong> qui valident =
la signature des paquets avant leur installation.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6557" data-end=3D"6759">
<li data-start=3D"6557" data-end=3D"6659" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6559" data-end=3D"6659" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
559" data-end=3D"6573">apt-secure</strong> : V=C3=A9rifie les paquets t=C3=
=A9l=C3=A9charg=C3=A9s pour s'assurer qu'ils proviennent de sources s=C3=BB=
res.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6660" data-end=3D"6759" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6662" data-end=3D"6759" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
662" data-end=3D"6682">dnf-plugins-core</strong> : Permet =C3=A0 DNF de v=
=C3=A9rifier la signature des paquets avant leur installation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6761" data-end=3D"6793" class=3D"">4.2. S=C3=A9curisation=
 des D=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6795" data-end=3D"6905" class=3D"">Pour assurer que vos mi=
ses =C3=A0 jour proviennent de d=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts s=C3=BBrs, vous devez s=C3=
=A9curiser les sources de vos paquets.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6907" data-end=3D"7209">
<li data-start=3D"6907" data-end=3D"7075" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6909" data-end=3D"7075" class=3D"">Pour <strong data-start=
=3D"6914" data-end=3D"6921">APT</strong> : =C3=89ditez le fichier <strong d=
ata-start=3D"6942" data-end=3D"6967">/etc/apt/sources.list</strong> pour vo=
us assurer que vous utilisez des d=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts officiels et s=C3=A9curis=
=C3=A9s (par exemple, https au lieu de http).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7076" data-end=3D"7209" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7078" data-end=3D"7209" class=3D"">Pour <strong data-start=
=3D"7083" data-end=3D"7094">DNF/YUM</strong> : V=C3=A9rifiez que vos d=C3=
=A9p=C3=B4ts dans <strong data-start=3D"7126" data-end=3D"7147">/etc/yum.re=
pos.d/</strong> sont configur=C3=A9s correctement avec des signatures de s=
=C3=A9curit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7211" data-end=3D"7259" class=3D"">4.3. V=C3=A9rification=
 de l'Int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9 des Paquets</h3>
<p data-start=3D"7261" data-end=3D"7445" class=3D"">Une fois les mises =C3=
=A0 jour install=C3=A9es, vous pouvez v=C3=A9rifier l'int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9 d=
es paquets avec <strong data-start=3D"7349" data-end=3D"7360">debsums</stro=
ng> pour les paquets Debian/Ubuntu ou <strong data-start=3D"7395" data-end=
=3D"7402">rpm</strong> pour les distributions bas=C3=A9es sur Red Hat.</p>
