<h3 data-start=3D"2058" data-end=3D"2120" class=3D"">2.2. Configuration de =
SSH (fichier <code data-start=3D"2097" data-end=3D"2119">/etc/ssh/sshd_conf=
ig</code>)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2122" data-end=3D"2302" class=3D"">Le fichier principal de=
 configuration de SSH est situ=C3=A9 =C3=A0 <strong data-start=3D"2179" dat=
a-end=3D"2203">/etc/ssh/sshd_config</strong>. C'est ici que vous allez appl=
iquer la majorit=C3=A9 des changements pour s=C3=A9curiser vos connexions S=
SH.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"2304" data-end=3D"2347" class=3D"">2.2.1. D=C3=A9sactiver=
 l'Acc=C3=A8s Root via SSH</h4>
<p data-start=3D"2349" data-end=3D"2548" class=3D"">L'acc=C3=A8s root direc=
