nt =C3=A0 expert.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"783" data-end=3D"786" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"788" data-end=3D"837" class=3D"">1. Qu'est-ce que la plan=
ification des t=C3=A2ches ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"839" data-end=3D"1070" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=3D=
"842" data-end=3D"870">planification des t=C3=A2ches</strong> sous Linux pe=
rmet d'ex=C3=A9cuter des commandes ou des programmes =C3=A0 des moments d=
=C3=A9finis ou =C3=A0 intervalles r=C3=A9guliers. Cette capacit=C3=A9 est s=
ouvent utilis=C3=A9e pour automatiser des t=C3=A2ches r=C3=A9p=C3=A9titives=
 telles que :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1072" data-end=3D"1227">
<li data-start=3D"1072" data-end=3D"1100" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1074" data-end=3D"1100" class=3D"">La sauvegarde des donn=
=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1101" data-end=3D"1149" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1103" data-end=3D"1149" class=3D"">L'ex=C3=A9cution de scr=
ipts d'entretien du syst=C3=A8me.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1150" data-end=3D"1184" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1152" data-end=3D"1184" class=3D"">L'envoi de rapports aut=
omatis=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1185" data-end=3D"1227" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1187" data-end=3D"1227" class=3D"">La gestion des mises =
=C3=A0 jour logicielles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1229" data-end=3D"1409" class=3D"">Les outils de planifica=
tion permettent aux administrateurs de configurer des t=C3=A2ches sans inte=
rvention manuelle, ce qui augmente l'efficacit=C3=A9 et r=C3=A9duit les ris=
ques d'erreur humaine.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1411" data-end=3D"1414" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1416" data-end=3D"1471" class=3D"">2. Les Outils de Plani=
fication des T=C3=A2ches sous Linux</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1473" data-end=3D"1558" class=3D"">Linux propose plusieurs=
 outils pour planifier des t=C3=A2ches. Les trois principaux sont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1560" data-end=3D"1872">
<li data-start=3D"1560" data-end=3D"1663" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1562" data-end=3D"1663" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
562" data-end=3D"1570">cron</strong> : utilis=C3=A9 pour ex=C3=A9cuter des =
t=C3=A2ches =C3=A0 des moments sp=C3=A9cifiques ou =C3=A0 des intervalles r=
=C3=A9guliers.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1664" data-end=3D"1755" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1666" data-end=3D"1755" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
