<h3 data-start=3D"4845" data-end=3D"4881" class=3D"">4.1. Introduction aux =
<strong data-start=3D"4871" data-end=3D"4881">Timers</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4883" data-end=3D"5075" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"4887" data-end=3D"4902">timer units</strong> de <strong data-start=3D"4=
906" data-end=3D"4917">systemd</strong> sont utilis=C3=A9s pour planifier d=
