<p data-start=3D"3332" data-end=3D"3458" class=3D"">Cet outil peut sembler =
complexe, mais il est tr=C3=A8s puissant. Voici les principales sections qu=
e vous trouverez dans cet outil :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3460" data-end=3D"4043">
<li data-start=3D"3460" data-end=3D"3559" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3462" data-end=3D"3559" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
462" data-end=3D"3479">General setup</strong> : Options g=C3=A9n=C3=A9rales=
, comme le nom du noyau, les param=C3=A8tres de compilation, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3560" data-end=3D"3683" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3562" data-end=3D"3683" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
562" data-end=3D"3593">Processor type and features</strong> : Param=C3=A8tr=
es li=C3=A9s =C3=A0 l'architecture du processeur (multi-threading, CPU sp=
=C3=A9cifique, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3684" data-end=3D"3820" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3686" data-end=3D"3820" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
686" data-end=3D"3704">Device Drivers</strong> : S=C3=A9lection des pilotes=
 mat=C3=A9riels =C3=A0 inclure dans le noyau (carte graphique, p=C3=A9riph=
=C3=A9riques USB, carte r=C3=A9seau, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3821" data-end=3D"3887" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3823" data-end=3D"3887" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
823" data-end=3D"3845">Networking support</strong> : Options relatives au s=
upport du r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3888" data-end=3D"3968" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3890" data-end=3D"3968" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
890" data-end=3D"3906">File systems</strong> : Choix des syst=C3=A8mes de f=
ichiers support=C3=A9s (ext4, XFS, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3969" data-end=3D"4043" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3971" data-end=3D"4043" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
971" data-end=3D"3989">Kernel hacking</strong> : Options avanc=C3=A9es pour=
 le d=C3=A9bogage et le diagnostic.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4045" data-end=3D"4131" class=3D"">Les options sont souven=
t de type <code data-start=3D"4078" data-end=3D"4083">[*]</code> (activ=C3=
=A9), <code data-start=3D"4094" data-end=3D"4099">[ ]</code> (d=C3=A9sactiv=
=C3=A9), et <code data-start=3D"4116" data-end=3D"4121">[M]</code> (module)=
.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4133" data-end=3D"4183" class=3D"">Exemple : S=C3=A9lecti=
onner un Syst=C3=A8me de Fichiers</h4>
<p data-start=3D"4185" data-end=3D"4392" class=3D"">Dans la section <strong=
 data-start=3D"4201" data-end=3D"4217">File systems</strong>, vous pouvez s=
=C3=A9lectionner les syst=C3=A8mes de fichiers que vous souhaitez que votre=
 noyau prenne en charge. Par exemple, si vous voulez utiliser le syst=C3=A8=
me de fichiers <strong data-start=3D"4382" data-end=3D"4390">ext4</strong> =
:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4394" data-end=3D"4513">
<li data-start=3D"4394" data-end=3D"4422" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4396" data-end=3D"4422" class=3D"">Allez dans <code data-s=
tart=3D"4407" data-end=3D"4421">File systems</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4423" data-end=3D"4513" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4425" data-end=3D"4513" class=3D"">Activez <code data-star=
t=3D"4433" data-end=3D"4439">ext4</code> en s=C3=A9lectionnant <code data-s=
tart=3D"4457" data-end=3D"4464">[ * ]</code> =C3=A0 c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 de "Ext4=
 journaling file system support".</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"4515" data-end=3D"4554" class=3D"">Exemple : S=C3=A9lecti=
onner des Pilotes</h4>
<p data-start=3D"4556" data-end=3D"4740" class=3D"">Dans la section <strong=
 data-start=3D"4572" data-end=3D"4590">Device Drivers</strong>, vous pouvez=
 s=C3=A9lectionner des pilotes pour les p=C3=A9riph=C3=A9riques que vous ut=
ilisez. Par exemple, pour activer un pilote pour une carte graphique NVIDIA=
 :</p>
